<title>USA: Kroger Co sets $200 mln in senior notes.</title>
<headline>Kroger Co sets $200 mln in senior notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Kroger Co was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Kroger Co, located in Cincinnati, Ohio operates supermarkets and convenience stores.</p>
<p>BORROWER KROGER CO</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.65 PCT   MATURITY 4/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 99.837  FIRST PAY DATE 10/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 7.673 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD +80 BP     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-    ))</p>
